<title>ROMANIA: Romanian producer prices 13.2 pct up in July.</title>
<headline>Romanian producer prices 13.2 pct up in July.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry soared by 13.2 percent in July from the previous month following energy and fuel price hikes, National Statistics Board (CNS) data showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Prices were up 54.2 percent year-on-year in July.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	  JULY     JUNE     JULY 95</p>
<p> mth/mth change		     +13.2     +3.6	+3.3</p>
<p>  extraction industry	     +36.6     +0.1	+1.2</p>
<p>  processing industry		+7.9     +4.2	+3.6</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	 +47.9     +0.2	+2.7</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
